          "block_order": null
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "2.人口东多西少",
          "block_bbox": [
            229,
            486,
            554,
            537
          ],
          "block_id": 1,
          "block_order": 1
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(1)人口密度：我国平均人口密度为每平方干米134人，是世界平均人口密度的3倍.",
          "block_bbox": [
            288,
            576,
            1887,
            636
          ],
          "block_id": 2,
          "block_order": 2
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(2)人口分布特点：以黑河(黑龙江省)——腾冲(云南省)为界，东多西少。",
          "block_bbox": [
            290,
            675,
            1787,
            730
          ],
          "block_id": 3,
          "block_order": 3
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(3)34个省级行政区中。人口最多的是河南省，人口最少的是澳门特别行政区，人口密度最大的是澳门特别行政区，人口密度最小的是西藏自治区。23个省中，人口密度最大的是江苏省.\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            200,
            768,
            1984,
            1013
          ],
          "block_id": 4,
          "block_order": 4
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "多民族的大家庭",
          "block_bbox": [
            205,
            1142,
            586,
            1201
          ],
          "block_id": 5,
          "block_order": 5
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "1、56个民族",
          "block_bbox": [
            220,
            1243,
            484,
            1296
          ],
          "block_id": 6,
          "block_order": 6
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(0人口数最多的是汉族，占全国人口总数的92%.",
          "block_bbox": [
            272,
            1338,
            1281,
            1395
          ],
          "block_id": 7,
          "block_order": 7
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(2)少数民族人口最多的是壮族，最少是巴族，人口在400万以上的少数民族有壮族，满族、回族、苗族、维吾尔族、彝族、土家族、蒙古族、藏族.",
          "block_bbox": [
            194,
            1430,
            1984,
            1583
          ],
          "block_id": 8,
          "block_order": 8
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(3)各民族有独特的风俗习惯，文化艺术和传统的体育活动.如汉族的端干节.傣族的泼水节.蒙古族的那达慕大会，维吾尔族的开斋节，彝族的火把节、朝鲜族的长鼓舞等。\n",
          "block_bbox": [
            192,
            1616,
            1993,
            1867
          ],
          "block_id": 9,
          "block_order": 9
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(4)民族政策：各民族不论大小、一律平等",
          "block_bbox": [
            282,
            1907,
            1147,
            1965
          ],
          "block_id": 10,
          "block_order": 10
        },
        {
          "block_label": "paragraph_title",
          "block_content": "2.民族的分布",
          "block_bbox": [
            199,
            2098,
            545,
            2151
          ],
          "block_id": 11,
          "block_order": 11
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(1)民族分布持点：大杂居，小聚居",
          "block_bbox": [
            278,
            2192,
            994,
            2250
          ],
          "block_id": 12,
          "block_order": 12
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(2)汉族：遍及全国，主要集中在东部和中部.",
          "block_bbox": [
            270,
            2286,
            1254,
            2343
          ],
          "block_id": 13,
          "block_order": 13
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "(3)少数民族：主要分布在西南.西北和东北部地区.",
          "block_bbox": [
            276,
            2383,
            1323,
            2439
          ],
          "block_id": 14,
          "block_order": 14
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "",
          "block_bbox": [
            477,
            2506,
            2036,
            2840
          ],
          "block_id": 15,
          "block_order": 15
        },
        {
          "block_label": "number",
